    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some crimes are crimes of passion. Others\u2026 are just too much passion. When a man dies from an overwhelmingly exciting nude, detective McSnoop is put on the strangest case of his career. To find the truth, he\u2019ll need to decrypt a stash of private nudes, fit the pieces together, and solve a mystery that\u2019s equal parts scandalous and ridiculous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only Cards is a unique blend of the card deck builder and jigsaw puzzle genres.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each &quot;battle&quot; you have a lot of piece cards. But you also have your deck of tool cards to help you solve the puzzle. Build the strongest deck to solve even the toughest puzzle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 beautiful girls, each with their own personality and story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many cards with interesting abilities. Infinite combinations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 spicy arts featuring girls with and without underwear.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No time limit, relaxing yet challenging gameplay.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609790/extras/dfdba122a0a93fe1b457ed34969c1ecc.poster.avif?t=1755694453\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609790/extras/dfdba122a0a93fe1b457ed34969c1ecc.webm?t=1755694453\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609790/extras/dfdba122a0a93fe1b457ed34969c1ecc.mp4?t=1755694453\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
